F ResolveTexturePaintWorkspace | TexturePaintSpecification.h | 117   | api,nonallocating,nonthrowing | ✔️ | The roster entry a host registers for texture painting. `RenderSchedule` put beneath the interface, and a routine painting over it here would hide the surface the workspace exists to present. roster `WorkspaceSpecification` warns about, and it presents as panels drawn against released storage.
